cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these packings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Moki&Julio: 6,071 new best-known packings of equal circles, spheres and hyperspheres in twenty-one Packomania containers"
authors:
  - name: "Moki&Julio"
date-released: 2026-09-26
version: "2.6"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22981305
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hashirama1337s/moki-julio-circle-packing"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - equal circles
  - Packomania
  - best-known packings
  - exact certificates
abstract: >-
  6,071 packings that improve the best-known records of Packomania's tables: equal circles in the isosceles right
  triangle (crt), the circular quadrant (ccq), eight fixed rectangles (crc_100 to crc_800), the semicircle (csc), the unit square
  (csq) and the regular pentagon (cpt), hexagon (chx), 15-gon (cpd) and 16-gon (cxd), equal spheres in the unit cube (scu) and in
  the unit sphere (ssp), and equal balls in the unit ball of dimension 4, 5 and 6 (hsp4, hsp5, hsp6), each with an exact certificate verified by
  two independently written exact checkers. Results already surpassed in the literature (including spherical-code constructions)
  are excluded by a prior-art gate. Also: 58 table entries shown optimal by Ruda's 1970 lemma (not marked on Packomania) and
  complete, machine-checked exact proofs of two of Ruda's results.
